{aligned}],\\,{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=0 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535516 true] [17592186134213 1100 "Given the vector $x$ and the system of linear equations below, find the projection of $x$ onto the solution space of the system.\n\n$x = \\begin{bmatrix}11 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}, {x_{1} + x_{2} = 0; 2x_{1} + 2x_{2} = 0$" 13194139535516 false] [17592186134213 1145 "First, we need to find a basis of the solution space of the system. \n\nConsider the augmented matrix $M$ of the system, which we reduce to row echelon form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the reduced matrix above, there is $1$ pivot column (the $1$st one). Thus, ${x}_{2}$ is a free variable. From the first equation, we get ${x}_{1}=-{x}_{2}.$ So, the general solution is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]={x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nConsequently, $B={[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}$ is a basis of the solution space of the system.\n\nFinally, we find the projection of $x$ onto the solution space of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{b}\\,x & =\\frac{x\\cdot b}{b\\cdot b}b \\\\  & =\\frac{11\\cdot (-1)+3\\cdot 1}{{(-1)}^{2}+{1}^{2}}b \\\\  & =\\frac{-8}{2}b \\\\  & =-4b \\\\  & =-4[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535516 true] [17592186353152 1017 #edb/ref 17592186353153 13194139535516 true] [17592186353152 1089 "q-140114" 13194139535516 true] [17592186353152 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535516 true] [17592186353152 1100 "Let $a=[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 10 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]$ and $b=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].$ Find the orthogonal projection of $a$ onto $\\text{Span}{b}.$" 13194139535516 true] [17592186353152 1113 #uuid "6f05980d-4426-5706-8a2c-5e2131836b68" 13194139535516 true] [17592186353152 1145 "The orthogonal projection of $a$ onto $\\text{Span}{b}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{b\\cdot a}{b\\cdot b}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot 8+1\\cdot 4+(-1)\\cdot 10+2\\cdot 6}{{1}^{2}+{1}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{2}^{2}}b \\\\  & =\\frac{8+4-10+12}{1+1+1+4}b \\\\  & =\\frac{14}{7}b \\\\  & =2b \\\\  & =2[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535516 true] [17592186353153 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353154 13194139535516 true] [17592186353153 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353155 13194139535516 true] [17592186353153 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353156 13194139535516 true] [17592186353153 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353157 13194139535516 true] [17592186353153 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353158 13194139535516 true] [17592186353153 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535516 true] [17592186353153 1041 "selection" 13194139535516 true] [17592186353153 1104 #edb/ref 17592186353155 13194139535516 true] [17592186353153 1110 #uuid "6182e784-b047-5409-b54f-fbb1b830013a" 13194139535516 true] [17592186353154 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535516 true] [17592186353154 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535516 true] [17592186353154 1111 #uuid "c57186e7-acdd-556b-9a79-a59b057071a4" 13194139535516 true] [17592186353155 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535516 true] [17592186353155 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535516 true] [17592186353155 1111 #uuid "78e4cfed-2612-57ae-a2d3-d2024101c730" 13194139535516 true] [17592186353156 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535516 true] [17592186353156 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535516 true] [17592186353156 1111 #uuid "d935319d-0576-5f76-9c1a-9e89ba8fcb1d" 13194139535516 true] [1759218635